Spec: SDDStates
+: READY
~: IN_PROGRESS
>: REVIEW
?: BLOCKED
!: FAILED
@: HUMAN_ACTION
✓: DONE
-: CANCELLED
Transitions:
  + -> ~
  ~ -> >
  > -> ✓
  > -> !
  ! -> ~
  ! -> @
  ? -> +
  @ -> +
  @ -> -
  + -> -
  ~ -> ?
Rules:
  AI MUST preserve failure reason and attempts.
  AI MUST NOT mark DONE without VR.
  Equivalent repeated failures MUST NOT create infinite retry loops.
  HUMAN_ACTION requires an explicit human decision.
